{"body": "Washington does not currently have an individual income tax.\n\nBeginning Jan. 1, 2028, a new 9.9% income tax will apply to individuals and married couples filing jointly with annual adjusted gross income exceeding $1 million. The first return will be due in 2029.\n\nThe 2026 Washington State Legislature established this tax through Senate Bill 6346 .", "citation_label": "Income tax (Washington Department of Revenue): no individual income tax; 9.9% tax on adjusted gross income over $1 million from 2028 1", "citation_path": "us-wa/guidance/dor/income-tax/block-1", "document_class": "guidance", "expression_date": "2025-01-01", "heading": "Income tax", "id": "37254059-8752-5ae7-8099-5c63f940a077", "jurisdiction": "us-wa", "kind": "block", "language": "en", "level": 2, "metadata": {"block_count": 5, "content_type": "text/html; charset=UTF-8", "discovered_via": "manual-review:tax-agent-queue; index https://dor.wa.gov/taxes-rates/other-taxes/capital-gains-tax", "document_subtype": "agency_web_page", "download_url": "https://dor.wa.gov/taxes-rates/income-tax", "index_url": "https://dor.wa.gov/taxes-rates/other-taxes/capital-gains-tax", "kind": "block", "primary_source": true, "program": "individual_income_tax", "source_authority": "Washington State Department of Revenue", "source_discovery_group": "us-wa/guidance/individual-income-tax", "source_family": "state-individual-income-tax-guidance-ty2025", "source_url": "https://dor.wa.gov/taxes-rates/income-tax", "tax_year": "2025", "title": "Income tax (Washington Department of Revenue): no individual income tax; 9.9% tax on adjusted gross income over $1 million from 2028"}, "ordinal": 1, "parent_citation_path": "us-wa/guidance/dor/income-tax", "parent_id": "47bd9cb2-0e80-5c93-96e3-c1f26527c8f7", "source_as_of": "2026-09-10", "source_format": "html", "source_id": "us-wa-dor-income-tax-ty2025", "source_path": "sources/us-wa/guidance/2026-09-10-tax-state-guidance-ty2025/official-documents/us-wa-dor-income-tax-ty2025.html", "source_url": "https://dor.wa.gov/taxes-rates/income-tax", "version": "2026-09-10-tax-state-guidance-ty2025"}
