-special-notice-capital-gains-tiered-rates-ty2025.html", "source_url": "https://dor.wa.gov/forms-publications/publications-subject/special-notices/new-tiered-rates-washingtons-capital-gains-tax", "version": "2026-09-10-tax-state-guidance-ty2025"}
{"body": "Your first $1 million in taxable Washington capital gains is subject to tax at a rate of 7%. Any amount of Washington capital gains exceeding $1 million is subject to a 7% tax, plus an additional 2.9% tax.\n\nTax rate On taxable income from... Up to... 7% $1 $1,000,000 9.9% $1,000,001 And up", "citation_label": "Special Notice: New tiered rates for Washington's capital gains tax (tax year 2025) 2", "citation_path": "us-wa/guidance/dor/special-notice-capital-gains-tiered-rates/block-2", "document_class": "guidance", "expression_date": "2025-01-01", "heading": "What are the rates?", "id": "2fb5c70e-7410-568e-87ec-8a9b5b5a5617", "jurisdiction": "us-wa", "kind": "block", "language": "en", "level": 2, "metadata": {"block_count": 6, "content_type": "text/html; charset=UTF-8", "discovered_via": "manual-review:tax-agent-queue; index https://dor.wa.gov/taxes-rates/other-taxes/capital-gains-tax", "document_subtype": "special_notice", "download_url": "https://dor.wa.gov/forms-publications/publications-subject/special-notices/new-tiered-rates-washingtons-capital-gains-tax", "index_url": "https://dor.wa.gov/taxes-rates/other-taxes/capital-gains-tax", "kind": "block", "primary_source": true, "program": "individual_income_tax", "source_authority": "Washington State Department of Revenue", "source_discovery_group": "us-wa/guidance/individual-income-tax", "source_family": "state-individual-income-tax-guidance-ty2025", "source_url": "https://dor.wa.gov/forms-publications/publications-subject/special-notices/new-tiered-rates-washingtons-capital-gains-tax", "tax_year": "2025", "title": "Special Notice: New tiered rates for Washington's capital gains tax (tax year 2025)"}, "ordinal": 2, "parent_citation_path": "us-wa/guidance/dor/special-notice-capital-gains-tiered-rates", "parent_id": "50626bff-5fc7-5e62-8ddf-1d17e655e08c", "source_as_of": "2026-09-10", "source_format": "html", "source_id": "us-wa-dor-special-notice-capital-gains-tiered-rates-ty2025", "source_path": "sources/